sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Admin invites another administrator
  participant U as Admin
  participant C as Admin Console
  participant A as Express API
  participant S as Supabase
  participant L as Activity Log
  U->>C: Enter username, password and role
  C->>A: POST /api/admin/admins
  A->>S: adminUsers.createAdminUser(...)
  S-->>A: created user
  A->>L: record admin_user.created
  A-->>C: 201 user
  C-->>U: Show in admin list
  Note over S: Passwords are hashed before insert, duplicate usernames return 409.
